  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Ni Yu blessed land, over tea, Tan Bi Ya tells Dong Fang Chang Fan that Supreme Elder Ye Lui Lai has secretly entrusted an Immortal Gu to Ye Lui Sang, already an open secret in their circle, and that Ye Lui Sang is thought to have a high chance this round. Dong Fang Chang Fan answers that the tribe belongs to the Huang Jin bloodline among Northern Plains super tribes, has not owned Imperial Court for the last eight rounds, and that Hei Cheng of Hei tribe has mocked Ye Lui Lai over that record, which is why Ye Lui Lai is mobilizing Immortal Gu this time.",
      "chapters": [
        514
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-gu-talk",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_ni_yu_blessed_land",
        "char_tan_bi_ya",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
        "char_ye_lui_lai",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_ye_lui_sang",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "loc_imperial_court",
        "char_hei_cheng",
        "fac_hei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Ye Lui Sang takes Yang tribe and before Ye Lui army digests those gains, Ma tribe rushes three days and three nights, catches him off-guard, and defeats Ye Lui army. Ye Lui Sang escapes with his remaining troops and submits to Hei tribe army.",
      "chapters": [
        536
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ma-tribe-pursuit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_yang_tribe",
        "fac_ma_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, inside Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, Ye Lui Sang is still named the current tribe leader of Ye Lui tribe, a super tribe, but because they lost he had to join Hei tribe.",
      "chapters": [
        584
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
